# q2-usbtrace trace format (docs/internals.md#usb-tracer), built from a device log for test/unit/test_usb_fsm.py.
# Source: pd18-owner2.log, 2026-11-23, V1PXi, a read-only sampler every 0.25 s (uptime), the owner's rounds 1 to 3
# with a laptop's USB-C cable; stock's otg-on and otg-trial-off from q2-usb-2.log (demo ms 17780646 and 17789643,
# uptime = demo + 4.13 s here: owner2's PD17 went low with the power at 17784.78). Round 3: the cable back in at
# 17777.35 brought PD18 low and no VBUS (the Q2 resolved as the source), out at 17833.67, replugged at 17841.91.
# The sampler has no online field: 1 is assumed while the laptop's VBUS is in, 0 otherwise.
